   "text": {
    "L1": "A number pattern follows a rule from one number to the next.",
    "L2": "Do not use only the first step. Find the change at every step and check it.",
    "L3": "In 7, 12, 17, 22, every step adds 5.",
    "L4": "So the rule is add 5. Apply it to 22: the next number is 27.",
    "L5": "Patterns can also go down. For example, 50, 45, 40 goes down by 5 each time.",
    "L6": "Some steps change regularly. On a calendar, moving down one column adds 7 days.",
    "L7": "Now use the checked rule to choose the next number."
   },
